74,1375],[1425,1426],[1462,1463],[1464,1465],[1476,1477],[1498,1499],[1556,1557],[1601,1602],[1675,1722],"\n            Simple pricing. Start free, choose later.\n          </h1>",[1793,1794],[1886,1983],"\n            required. Choose the plan that best fits your business—you can change it before billing\n            begins.",[1998,1999],[2014,2015],[2016,2017],[2069,2070],[2108,2109],[2166,2167],[2188,2189],[2208,2209],[2239,2240],[2307,2308],[2341,2342],[2423,2424],[2457,2458],[2479,2524],"  ? \"border-primary/60 ring-1 ring-primary/10\"",[2525,2550],"                      : \"\"",[2570,2571],[2587,2588],[2625,2626],[2782,2783],[2816,2817],[2842,2843],[2862,2863],[2934,2935],[3020,3021],[3060,3061],[3144,3145],[3214,3215],[3238,3239],[3302,3303],[3349,3350],[3406,3407],[3488,3489],[3528,3529],[3555,3556],[3578,3579],[3601,3602],[3626,3709],"\n                  asChild\n                  className=\"mt-6 w-full\"\n                  variant={plan.highlight ? \"default\" : \"outline\"}\n                >",[3809,3810],[3836,3837],[3858,3859],[3874,3875],[3889,3890],[3905,3906],[3907,3908],[3979,3980],[4070,4071],[4143,4173],"\n            Need something custom?\n          </Link>",[4186,4187],[4204,4205],[4227,4228],[4233,4234],[4236,4237],[710,710],[1099,1099],[2784,2812],"\n            {data.store.name ?? \"Store\"}\n          ",[2851,2920],"(\n            <p className=\"text-sm text-neutral-600 mt-1\">{data.store.address}</p>\n          )",[6655,6690],"Powered by SEZA POS",[1493,1527],"\n      if (data.session) setReady(true);\n   ",[2678,2731],"\n              <KeyRound className=\"size-5\" /> Choose a new password\n            ",[3208,3364],"\n                  id=\"pw\"\n                  type=\"password\"\n                  autoComplete=\"new-password\"\n                  value={password}\n                  onChange={(e) => setPassword(e.target.value)}\n                  minLength={8}\n                  required\n                  disabled={!ready}\n               ",[3515,3670],"\n                  id=\"pw2\"\n                  type=\"password\"\n                  autoComplete=\"new-password\"\n                  value={confirm}\n                  onChange={(e) => setConfirm(e.target.value)}\n                  minLength={8}\n                  required\n                  disabled={!ready}\n               ",[4035,4050],"\n                  Back to sign in\n                ",[466,676],"\n        name: \"description\",\n        content:\n          \"How SEZA POS protects merchant data through encrypted connections, row-level authorization, role controls, audited operations, signed payment webhooks and Stripe-hosted billing.\",\n     ",[751,883],"\n        property: \"og:description\",\n        content:\n          \"Encrypted connections, access controls, audit trails and Stripe-hosted subscription billing.\",\n     ",[953,1145],"\n    icon: Lock,\n    title: \"Encrypted connections\",\n    body: \"Production traffic is served over HTTPS/TLS so information is encrypted while moving between supported browsers, devices and SEZA services.\",\n ",[1152,1359],"\n    icon: KeyRound,\n    title: \"Least-privilege access\",\n    body: \"Merchant records are protected with database authorization rules. Employees receive access based on the store, role and permissions assigned to them.\",\n ",[1366,1598],"\n    icon: Cloud,\n    title: \"Managed data platform\",\n    body: \"SEZA uses managed cloud database and application services with provider security controls, operational monitoring and backup capabilities configured for the deployed environment.\",\n ",[1605,1809],"\n    icon: Server,\n    title: \"Separated surfaces\",\n    body: \"The public website, merchant dashboard, Android register and platform-admin workflows are separated and require the appropriate authentication and role.\",\n ",[1816,1987],"\n    icon: Eye,\n    title: \"Audit history\",\n    body: \"Sensitive operations—including refunds, voids, cash movements, permission changes and admin actions—can be recorded for review.\",\n ",[1994,2222],"\n    icon: FileCheck,\n    title: \"Stripe-hosted billing\",\n    body: `SEZA Subscription card details are handled by ${LEGAL_CONFIG.billingProcessor}. SEZA receives payment tokens and status information rather than storing full card numbers.`,\n ",[2525,2564],"\n          Security is designed into the workflow.\n        ",[2726,2808],"\n          integrations and operational safeguards designed for a multi-tenant point-of-sale\n         ",[3590,3657],"\n            <Shield className=\"size-5 text-primary\" /> Merchant data boundaries\n          ",[3832,3998],"\n            merchant and store. Application queries are expected to pass through authorization\n            policies, while elevated platform operations require separate admin access and are\n           ",[4154,4221],"\n            <AlertTriangle className=\"size-5 text-primary\" /> Incident response\n          ",[4390,4654],"\n            preserve evidence, restore safe service, assess affected data and notify customers or\n            authorities when required by law. Report suspected issues to{\" \"}\n            <a className=\"text-primary underline\" href={`mailto:${LEGAL_CONFIG.securityEmail}`}>\n              {LEGAL_CONFIG.securityEmail}\n            </a>\n            ",[4904,5190],"{\" \"}\n            <a className=\"text-primary underline\" href={`mailto:${LEGAL_CONFIG.securityEmail}`}>\n              {LEGAL_CONFIG.securityEmail}\n            </a>\n            . Do not disrupt live stores, use social engineering, access more data than necessary to\n            demonstrate the issue, or publish sensitive details before SEZA has a reasonable\n           ",[5476,5573],"\n          Review the Trust Center and Legal Center for security, privacy and data-processing\n          documentation.\n        ",[5671,5714],"\n            <Link to=\"/trust\">Visit Trust Center</Link>\n          ",[5768,5805],"\n            <Link to=\"/legal\">Legal Center</Link>\n          ",[2656,2757],"\n              key={p.id}\n              className={\n                p.highlight ? \"border-primary shadow-lg ring-1 ring-primary/20 relative\" : \"\"\n              }\n            ",[3576,3637],"\n                      <Check className=\"h-4 w-4 text-primary shrink-0 mt-0.5\" />\n                      {f}\n                    ",[8,64]," createFileRoute, Link, useNavigate, useSearch ",[422,492]," Card, CardContent, CardHeader, CardTitle, CardDescription ",[2121,2194],".string().min(8, \"Password must be at least 8 characters\")",[2457,2477],"search.plan",[2617,2705],"Intl.DateTimeFormat().resolvedOptions().timeZone || \"America/New_York\"",[4278,4286],[4708,4818]," href={marketingUrl(\"/\")} className=\"flex items-center justify-center gap-2 mb-6\"",[5702,5753],"{planLabel}",[5784,5914]," to=\"/pricing\" className=\"ml-auto text-xs text-primary hover:underline\"",[7539,7601],"At least 8 characters.",{"messageId":"40605","fix":"41336","desc":"40607"},{"messageId":"40608","fix":"41337","desc":"40610"},[11892,11970],"err instanceof Error ? err.message : \"Could not resend email\"",[12948,13037]," activate your\n            account and start your 14-day free trial. The link",[13549,13604]," ? `Resend in ${cooldown}s`",[13791,13919]," type=\"button\" className=\"text-primary hover:underline\" onClick={onReset}",[14278,14334],"Developer diagnostic",[14365,14511]," type=\"button\" onClick={refresh} className=\"text-amber-700 hover:underline\"",[15142,15169],[15370,15446],"Error: {devStatus.error_message}",[15659,15659]," moment or click",[15681,15697],{"desc":"41338","fix":"41339"},{"kind":"40623","justification":"25982"},[408,409],[2015,2016],[544,674],"\n        name: \"description\",\n        content:\n          \"Current SEZA POS platform, authentication, database, dashboard, sync, and billing service status.\",\n     ",[905,1035],"\n  status: \"operational\" | \"degraded\";\n  services: Record<string, string>;\n  responseTimeMs: number;\n  checkedAt: string;\n  version: string;\n",[1539,1718],"\n          className={`flex items-center gap-4 rounded-2xl border p-6 ${operational ? \"border-emerald-300 bg-emerald-50 dark:border-emerald-500/25 dark:bg-emerald-500/10\" : \"bg-muted/30\"}`}\n        ",[1734,1869],"\n            className={`grid size-12 place-items-center rounded-full ${operational ? \"bg-emerald-600 text-white\" : \"bg-primary/10 text-primary\"}`}\n          ",[1903,2037],"(\n              <Loader2 className=\"size-7 animate-spin\" />\n            ) : operational ? (\n              <CheckCircle2 className=\"size-7\" />\n            ) : (\n              <AlertTriangle className=\"size-7\" />\n            )",[2119,2241],"\n              {health.isLoading\n                ? \"Checking SEZA services…\"\n                : operational\n                  ? \"All systems operational\"\n                  : \"Some services may be degraded\"}\n            ",[2309,2389],"\n              Automatically refreshed every minute. Version {health.data?.version ?? \"1.2.2\"}.\n            ",[2481,2646],"\n            <CardTitle>Service health</CardTitle>\n            <CardDescription>\n              Live application-level checks. Provider-specific outages may take additional time to\n              confirm.\n            </CardDescription>\n          ",[2733,2811],"\n              health.data?.services ?? { website: health.isError ? \"degraded\" : \"checking\" },\n            ",[2928,3197],"\n                <span className=\"capitalize\">{name.replaceAll(\"_\", \" \")}</span>\n                <span\n                  className={\n                    status === \"operational\"\n                      ? \"font-medium text-emerald-600\"\n                      : \"font-medium text-amber-600\"\n                  }\n                >\n                  {status === \"operational\"\n                    ? \"Operational\"\n                    : status === \"checking\"\n                      ? \"Checking\"\n                      : \"Degraded\"}\n                </span>\n              ",[3381,3572],"\n            <div className=\"font-semibold\">Experiencing a register issue?</div>\n            <p className=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">\n              Contact customer service with the store name, device and time of the issue.\n            </p>\n          ",[3617,3769],"\n            <Button asChild>\n              <Link to=\"/support\">Contact support</Link>\n            </Button>\n            <Button asChild variant=\"outline\">\n              <Link to=\"/contact\">Report an issue</Link>\n            </Button>\n          ",[3826,3989],"(\n          <p className=\"mt-5 text-center text-xs text-muted-foreground\">\n            Last checked {new Date(health.data.checkedAt).toLocaleString()} ·{\" \"}\n            {health.data.responseTimeMs} ms\n          </p>\n        )",[527,685],"\n        name: \"description\",\n        content:\n          \"Get help with SEZA POS: setup, hardware, billing, and troubleshooting. Answers to common questions and how to reach our team.\",\n     ",[759,878],"\n        property: \"og:description\",\n        content: \"Setup, hardware, billing, and troubleshooting — get answers and reach our team.\",\n     ",[1137,1396],"\n    q: \"How does the free trial work?\",\n    a: \"Every new merchant can start a 14-day trial without entering a payment card. The trial does not automatically charge you; an authorized owner chooses a paid plan through Stripe to continue paid access after the trial.\",\n ",[1403,1683],"\n    q: \"Can I use my existing hardware?\",\n    a: \"SEZA can work with supported scanners, ESC/POS-oriented receipt printers, printer-driven cash drawers, and configured payment readers. Compatibility depends on the exact model, connection, device, and required drivers or native plugins.\",\n ",[1690,1888],"\n    q: \"How do I change my plan?\",\n    a: \"Sign in and go to Settings → Billing. You can upgrade, downgrade, update your card, or cancel. Upgrades are prorated; downgrades apply at the next billing cycle.\",\n ",[1895,2146],"\n    q: \"What happens if my internet goes down?\",\n    a: \"Supported Android registers can record eligible cash sales in a limited offline mode and synchronize them after connectivity returns. Card payments and cloud-only functions still require a connection.\",\n ",[2153,2434],"\n    q: \"How is my data backed up?\",\n    a: \"Store data is held in the configured managed cloud environment and protected with provider and application safeguards. Export availability depends on the record type, and merchants should maintain appropriate accounting and continuity records.\",\n ",[2441,2623],"\n    q: \"How do refunds work?\",\n    a: \"Any sale can be fully or partially refunded from the Sales page. Refunds can restock inventory automatically and require manager approval by default.\",\n ",[2630,2840],"\n    q: \"Do you support multiple stores?\",\n    a: \"The platform is being prepared for expanded multi-store operations. Review the current pricing and product pages before relying on a specific multi-location workflow.\",\n ",[2847,2985],"\n    q: \"How do I cancel?\",\n    a: \"Go to Settings → Billing → Cancel plan. Your access continues through the end of your current billing period.\",\n ",[3649,3811],"\n            icon: BookOpen,\n            title: \"Getting started\",\n            body: \"Set up your first store, add products, and take your first sale.\",\n            cta: \"Create account\",\n            to: \"/signup\" as const,\n         ",[3826,3986],"\n            icon: MessageSquare,\n            title: \"Contact us\",\n            body: \"Talk to a real person about pricing, hardware, or migrations.\",\n            cta: \"Send a message\",\n            to: \"/contact\" as const,\n         ",[4001,4198],"\n            icon: PhoneCall,\n            title: \"Call customer service\",\n            body: `${LEGAL_CONFIG.phoneDisplay} — tap to call for account, setup, sales, or hardware help.`,\n            href: `tel:${LEGAL_CONFIG.phone}`,\n            cta: \"Call now\",\n         ",[4213,4383],"\n            icon: Mail,\n            title: \"Email support\",\n            body: \"support@sezapos.com — send account, billing, or register questions here.\",\n            href: \"mailto:support@sezapos.com\",\n            cta: \"Email us\",\n         ",[4777,4805],"\n                <a href={c.href}>{c.cta}</a>\n              ",[4898,4929],"\n                <Link to={c.to!}>{c.cta}</Link>\n              ",[5128,5154],[5773,5873],"\n          className={cn(\n            \"h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform\",\n            open && \"rotate-180\",\n          )}\n       ",[63,64],[136,137],[188,189],[198,305],"\n  Shield,\n  Lock,\n  FileCheck,\n  Activity,\n  HeartHandshake,\n  BookOpen,\n  Database,\n  AlertCircle,\n} from \"lucide-react\";",[306,307],[356,357],[374,375],[387,388],[432,433],[441,632],"\n        name: \"description\",\n        content: `${LEGAL_CONFIG.companyName}'s Trust Center: security practices, compliance posture, system status, privacy, incident response, and responsible disclosure.`,\n      },",[700,701],[709,814],"\n        property: \"og:description\",\n        content: \"Security, compliance, status, privacy, and incident response.\",\n      },",[821,822],[828,829],[853,854],[858,859],[860,861],[877,878],[882,1011],"\n    icon: Shield,\n    title: \"Security\",\n    body: \"Encryption, access control, and defense in depth.\",\n    to: \"/security\",\n    external: false,\n  },",[1015,1148],"\n    icon: FileCheck,\n    title: \"Compliance\",\n    body: \"Merchant obligations, Stripe billing and certification limits.\",\n    slug: \"compliance\",\n  },",[1152,1311],"\n    icon: Activity,\n    title: \"System status\",\n    body: \"Live application health, service checks, and incident contact information.\",\n    to: \"/status\",\n    external: false,\n  },",[1315,1418],"\n    icon: Lock,\n    title: \"Privacy\",\n    body: \"How we collect, use, and protect your data.\",\n    slug: \"privacy\",\n  },",[1422,1562],"\n    icon: BookOpen,\n    title: \"Legal Center\",\n    body: \"Terms, privacy, availability, and all published policies.\",\n    to: \"/legal\",\n    external: false,\n  },",[1566,1710],"\n    icon: AlertCircle,\n    title: \"Incident response\",\n    body: \"How we detect, contain, and communicate incidents.\",\n    to: \"/security\",\n    external: false,\n  },",[1714,1854],"\n    icon: Lock,\n    title: \"Encryption\",\n    body: \"Protected connections and managed-service security controls.\",\n    to: \"/security\",\n    external: false,\n  },",[1858,2011],"\n    icon: Database,\n    title: \"Backups\",\n    body: \"Managed-provider recovery capabilities and merchant continuity planning.\",\n    to: \"/security\",\n    external: false,\n  },",[2015,2142],"\n    icon: HeartHandshake,\n    title: \"Responsible disclosure\",\n    body: `Report issues to ${LEGAL_CONFIG.securityEmail}.`,\n    mail: true,\n  },",[2145,2146],[2147,2148],[2171,2172],[2183,2184],[2205,2206],[2275,2276],[2373,2374],[2450,2488],"\n          How we earn and keep your trust.\n        </h1>",[2547,2548],[2648,2782],"\n          and reliability practices that underpin {LEGAL_CONFIG.productName}. It is app-owned\n          content and is not an independent certification.",[2795,2796],[2813,2814],[2815,2816],[2914,2915],[2943,2944],[2970,2971],[2986,2987],[3078,3079],[3139,3140],[3161,3162],[3226,3227],[3304,3305],[3321,3322],[3335,3336],[3431,3432],[3465,3535],"\n            return (\n              <Link key={t.title} to={t.to} className={cls}>\n                {inner}\n              </Link>\n            );",[3572,3676],"\n            return (\n              <Link key={t.title} to=\"/legal/$slug\" params={{ slug: t.slug }} className={cls}>\n                {inner}\n              </Link>\n            );",[3713,3813],"\n            retur